──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3. Permitted Uses
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

3.1 Internal use. You may use the Software internally within Your
    organization, including testing, evaluation, and production use
    in support of Your business operations.

3.2 Co-op use. Co-ops may use the Software to integrate their CORE-POS
    / FANNIE installations with HRR Foods LLC's wholesale ordering,
    catalog, pricing, invoicing, and image services (the "HRR
    Services"). This includes installation, configuration, modification
    for the co-op's own stores, and redistribution within the co-op's
    own multi-store group.

3.3 POS vendor integration. A vendor of point-of-sale software serving
    the cooperative grocery segment may integrate the Software into
    that vendor's product line, provided the resulting product is made
    available to Co-ops under terms no more restrictive than this
    license.

3.4 No competing service. You may NOT use the Software, alone or in
    combination with other code, to build, operate, or offer a service
    that competes with the HRR Services — for example, a wholesale
    ordering or catalog API that is not operated by HRR Foods LLC.

3.5 No resale as a stand-alone product. You may NOT sublicense, sell,
    or redistribute the Software, or any modified version of it, as a
    stand-alone product or hosted service whose primary purpose is to
    provide the functionality of the Software itself. Distribution
    embedded within a co-op's POS environment is permitted under
    Section 3.2 and 3.3 above.

